{
	quest.05A0AC380BB141A0.quest_desc: [
		"Not every item needs to go wherever the network sends it. &bRestrictive&r and &dDiversion&r Transporters give you more control over how items move through your &eLogistical Transporter&r network."
		""
		"&bRestrictive Transporter&r"
		""
		"Acts as an &6overflow&r route. Items will only enter it when they have nowhere else to go, making it useful for handling excess items or directing unwanted materials to a backup destination."
		""
		"&dDiversion Transporter&r"
		""
		"Acts as a &6priority&r route. It encourages items to pass through it before normal transporter paths, making it useful for directing specific items toward a preferred destination."
		""
		"Use both together to build organized item networks that know where your resources should - and shouldn't - go."
	]
	quest.05A0AC380BB141A0.quest_subtitle: "Control the flow of items"
	quest.05A0AC380BB141A0.title: "Transporters"
	quest.09E90B321012651A.quest_desc: [
		"The &bPersonal Chest&r gives you a private storage space that stays with you wherever you go."
		""
		"Unlike a normal chest, its contents can be accessed from any &bPersonal Chest&r linked to you, making it perfect for keeping frequently used items close at hand."
		""
		"Use it as your personal stash for tools, building materials, or anything else you don't want cluttering your inventory."
	]
	quest.09E90B321012651A.quest_subtitle: "Your storage, wherever you go"
	quest.0DA354D54D288D20.quest_desc: [
		"Thermodynamic Conductors transport &cHeat&r between machines and other heat-handling blocks, forming a shared &cThermodynamic Network&r."
		""
		"Each conductor added to the network increases its total &cHeat Capacity&r. The network also has a fixed &eConduction&r and &cInsulation&r value based on the conductor tier."
		""
		"The &cInsulation&r of your network is also affected by the &abiome&r you're in."
		""
		"In &cwarmer biomes&r, heat transfer is more efficient. In &bcolder biomes&r, the network becomes less efficient."
		""
		"As your heat systems grow, upgrade your conductors to keep up with the increasing &cHeat&r demands."
	]
	quest.0DA354D54D288D20.quest_subtitle: "Move heat where it's needed"
	quest.0DA354D54D288D20.title: "Thermodynamic Conductors"
	quest.0E36B0F444159DC6.quest_desc: [
		"The &bPersonal Barrel&r gives you a private storage space for keeping large quantities of &fitems&r close at hand."
		""
		"Like the &bPersonal Chest&r, its contents are tied to you, letting you access your stored items without needing to return to a specific location."
		""
		"Perfect for storing bulk resources while keeping your main storage system organized."
	]
	quest.0E36B0F444159DC6.quest_subtitle: "Your private bulk storage"
	quest.124D18DDDDC4D102.quest_desc: [
		"Universal Cables are the backbone of your &eMekanism&r power network. They transfer &eFE&r between generators, machines, Energy Cubes, and other compatible systems."
		""
		"Each cable in a network contributes to its total &9energy buffer&r and &etransfer capacity&r. As your power generation grows, upgrading your cables prevents them from becoming a bottleneck."
		""
		"The standard progression is:"
		""
		"&2Basic&r → &cAdvanced&r → &bElite&r → &dUltimate&r"
		""
		"With &5Mekanism Extras&r, the progression continues:"
		""
		"&eAbsolute&r → &4Supreme&r → &dCosmic&r → &zInfinite&r"
		""
		"Higher-tier cables can handle vastly more energy, making them essential for the enormous power demands of late-game machinery."
		""
		"Use a &eConfigurator&r to control cable connections and shape your power network exactly how you need it."
	]
	quest.124D18DDDDC4D102.quest_subtitle: "Move energy where it's needed"
	quest.124D18DDDDC4D102.title: "Universal Cables"
	quest.1646940008F2A109.quest_desc: [
		"The &bDictionary&r lets you look up the &9tags&r assigned to any &fitem&r or &bblock&r."
		""
		"Tags group similar items together, making them especially useful when setting up &6filters&r for your &bLogistical Sorters&r."
		""
		"Instead of adding every item individually, you can filter entire groups of items using their shared tags."
		""
		"When you're unsure which tag to use, check the &bDictionary&r first."
	]
	quest.1646940008F2A109.quest_subtitle: "Find the tags behind your items"
	quest.183E523C25CC6C3F.quest_desc: [
		"Logistical Transporters are Mekanism's item transportation system, allowing you to move &fitems&r between machines, inventories, and other containers."
		""
		"Each &6Basic Logistical Transporter&r can move up to &a2 items per second&r into a network when &cpulling&r items."
		""
		"Once an item is inside the network, it travels through the transporter at up to &e1.0 m/s&r. Higher-tier transporters can move items significantly faster."
		""
		"The &apush&r rate into a destination is effectively unlimited, so long as the item can enter the network in the first place."
		""
		"Use a &eConfigurator&r to configure connections, or add &bLogistical Sorters&r to control exactly where your items go."
	]
	quest.183E523C25CC6C3F.quest_subtitle: "Move items with ease"
	quest.183E523C25CC6C3F.title: "Logistical Transporters"
	quest.24B44DAA8C43CF11.quest_desc: [
		"The &bConfigurator&r is more than just a wrench - it's the essential tool for managing your &eMekanism&r setup."
		""
		"Hold &6SHIFT&r and &6scroll&r to switch between its different modes. The currently selected mode is displayed in the bottom-left of your screen."
		""
		"* &eConfigure&r"
		"Change the &binput&r and &coutput&r sides of machines without opening their GUI."
		""
		"* &7Empty&r"
		"Hold &6SHIFT + RIGHT-CLICK&r to empty the contents of a machine or container."
		""
		"* &aRotate&r"
		"Rotate machines with &aRIGHT-CLICK&r or &6SHIFT + RIGHT-CLICK&r, depending on the desired orientation."
		""
		"You can also &aRIGHT-CLICK&r a machine's face to make it face the side you're clicking."
	]
	quest.24B44DAA8C43CF11.quest_subtitle: "Configure your machines with ease"
	quest.24B44DAA8C43CF11.title: "Configurator"
	quest.2571BC62616A45AB.quest_desc: [
		"The &dQIO Dashboard&r is your interface to the &eQuantum Item Orchestration&r system."
		""
		"From here, you can access and manage all the &fitems&r stored within your connected &bQIO Drive Array&r."
		""
		"Search for items, view your storage, and interact with your network without having to dig through physical storage."
		""
		"For the best experience, place the dashboard somewhere convenient - your entire digital warehouse is only a few clicks away."
	]
	quest.2571BC62616A45AB.quest_subtitle: "Access your digital storage"
	quest.2571BC62616A45AB.title: "QIO Network"
	quest.264F371D2A18EAEC.quest_desc: [
		"Pressurized Tubes transport &9gases&r, &5infuse types&r, &dPigments&r, &5slurries&r, and other &eMekanism&r fluids between machines and containers."
		""
		"Each tube added to the network increases its total capacity and base throughput."
		""
		"The &bBasic Pressurized Tube&r provides &94000 mB/t&r of throughput per tube."
		""
		"When a tube is &6pulling&r contents into itself, its pulling rate is limited to &9750 mB/t&r."
		""
		"Machines and containers that &apush&r contents into the network use the full throughput of the connected tubes, allowing large networks to move huge amounts of material."
		""
		"Upgrade your tubes as your factory grows to keep your &echemical and fluid&r processing lines flowing."
	]
	quest.264F371D2A18EAEC.quest_subtitle: "Move fluids at high pressure"
	quest.264F371D2A18EAEC.title: "Pressurized Tubes"
	quest.2E97456B0ED0AB1A.quest_desc: [
		"The &bElectric Pump&r is your go-to tool for gathering &9fluids&r from the world and feeding them into your factory."
		""
		"Place the pump directly above the &9fluid&r you want to extract, provide it with &eFE&r, and connect a &bMechanical Pipe&r or &9Fluid Tank&r to its output."
		""
		"The pump can automatically extract fluids from large bodies of liquid, making it perfect for supplying your machines with a steady source of &9fluids&r."
		""
		"Install &bUpgrades&r to dramatically increase its pumping speed."
		""
		"Best of all, pumping &bwater&r does not consume the &9water source blocks&r - so you can keep drawing from the same source indefinitely."
	]
	quest.2E97456B0ED0AB1A.quest_subtitle: "Pull fluids from the world"
	quest.2E97456B0ED0AB1A.title: "Electric Pump"
	quest.30D584EAD9243548.quest_desc: [
		"The &bFluidic Plenisher&r lets you fill empty spaces with any &9fluid&r you provide."
		""
		"Feed it a &9fluid&r and it will replace open spaces beneath it, allowing you to create entire lakes, reservoirs, or even seas of virtually any fluid."
		""
		"Connect it to your &bMechanical Pipe&r network and let it do the work for you."
		""
		"Perfect for large-scale fluid projects - or simply making an absolutely massive pool of something that probably shouldn't be swimming in."
	]
	quest.30D584EAD9243548.quest_subtitle: "Fill the world with fluids"
	quest.30D584EAD9243548.title: "Fluidic Plenisher"
	quest.39A4FF688D140EC2.quest_desc: [
		"The &bLogistical Sorter&r is the brains of your &eitem transportation&r network, letting you control exactly where your items go."
		""
		"Set up &6filters&r to match specific items, tags, or even entire categories of resources. Filtered items can then be directed to a chosen destination within the network."
		""
		"You can use the &bDictionary&r to search for available item and block tags, making it much easier to create broad or highly specific filters."
		""
		"Combine Sorters with &bRestrictive&r and &dDiversion Transporters&r to create reliable, automated item routing throughout your factory."
	]
	quest.39A4FF688D140EC2.quest_subtitle: "Sort your items with precision"
	quest.39A4FF688D140EC2.title: "Logistical Sorter"
	quest.43985FE38B0EBCB5.quest_desc: [
		"Mechanical Pipes are Mekanism's primary way of transporting &9fluids&r between machines, tanks, and other compatible containers."
		""
		"Pipes form a shared network, allowing fluids to flow between connected machines and storage."
		""
		"Use &6pull&r connections to draw fluids into the network, while &apush&r connections send fluids toward connected destinations."
		""
		"Higher-tier pipes provide greater capacity and throughput, making them important as your fluid processing systems grow."
		""
		"Use a &eConfigurator&r to manage connections and control how fluids move through your network."
	]
	quest.43985FE38B0EBCB5.quest_subtitle: "Move fluids where they're needed"
	quest.43985FE38B0EBCB5.title: "Mechanical Pipes"
	quest.4CA2A53F4C298E2B.quest_desc: [
		"The &dPortable QIO Dashboard&r lets you access your &dQIO Storage System&r from anywhere in the world."
		""
		"No need to run back to your base whenever you need an item. Open your &dQIO&r network directly from your inventory and access your digital storage on the go."
		""
		"Pair it with a &bQIO Drive Array&r and &bQIO Drives&r to keep your entire storage system at your fingertips."
	]
	quest.4CA2A53F4C298E2B.quest_subtitle: "Access your storage anywhere"
	quest.4CA2A53F4C298E2B.title: "Portable QIO Dashboard"
	quest.5399B28FAC1756EF.quest_desc: [
		"Bins are compact storage blocks designed for holding large quantities of &fitems&r."
		""
		"They are especially useful for bulk resources such as &7Cobblestone&r, &7Stone&r, ores, and other materials you produce in large amounts."
		""
		"Connect them to &bLogistical Transporters&r to automatically insert and extract items, making them a great addition to automated storage systems."
		""
		"Higher-tier bins provide significantly more storage, letting you keep your most common resources neatly contained without filling up your base with chests."
	]
	quest.5399B28FAC1756EF.quest_subtitle: "Keep your resources organized"
	quest.5399B28FAC1756EF.title: "Bins"
	quest.565AF8294E95CBA7.quest_desc: [
		"Energy Cubes are Mekanism's portable energy storage blocks, allowing you to store and move large amounts of &eFE&r."
		""
		"Connect them to &bUniversal Cables&r to charge and discharge your stored energy, or use them as buffers between &egenerators&r and machines."
		""
		"Higher-tier Energy Cubes provide greater storage capacity and higher transfer rates, making them increasingly useful as your power network grows."
		""
		"They can also be configured to automatically charge or discharge from connected sides using a &eConfigurator&r."
	]
	quest.565AF8294E95CBA7.quest_subtitle: "Store your power for later"
	quest.565AF8294E95CBA7.title: "Energy Cubes"
	quest.67A41E4D6BCA5F2B.quest_desc: [
		"The &bQIO Drive Array&r is the core of the &eQuantum Item Orchestration&r system, providing a central place to manage your digital item storage."
		""
		"Insert &bQIO Drives&r to store huge quantities of items digitally, all accessible through your connected &eQIO&r network."
		""
		"Keep your drives safe - losing the Drive Array means losing access to everything stored inside it."
	]
	quest.67A41E4D6BCA5F2B.quest_subtitle: "The heart of your item storage"
	quest.67A41E4D6BCA5F2B.title: "QIO Drive Array"
	quest.6EA29403BF85B19C.quest_desc: [
		"QIO Drives are the storage units used by the &bQIO Drive Array&r. Each drive expands the amount of &fitems&r your network can store digitally."
		""
		"The &dQIO Drive&r can hold up to &a16,000 items&r across &b128 different item types&r."
		""
		"Need more storage? Simply add more drives to your &bQIO Drive Array&r and keep expanding your digital warehouse."
		""
		"Higher-capacity drives become available as you progress, letting your storage system grow alongside your factory."
	]
	quest.6EA29403BF85B19C.quest_subtitle: "Expand your digital storage"
	quest.6EA29403BF85B19C.title: "QIO Drives"
	quest.722818115860F349.quest_desc: [
		"Fluid Tanks provide convenient storage for &9fluids&r, giving you somewhere to keep the liquids your machines produce or require."
		""
		"They can be connected to &bMechanical Pipes&r and other compatible systems to automatically fill and drain the tank."
		""
		"Higher-tier tanks offer significantly more storage, making them ideal for keeping large reserves of &9fluids&r on hand."
		""
		"Use a &eConfigurator&r to manage connections and control how fluids flow in and out."
	]
	quest.722818115860F349.quest_subtitle: "Store your fluids for later"
	quest.73156BF022D5710F.quest_desc: [
		"Chemical Tanks are designed to safely store &dGases&r and other &5chemical substances&r used throughout your &eMekanism&r factory."
		""
		"Connect them to &bPressurized Tubes&r to move chemicals between machines, or use them as convenient storage for large reserves."
		""
		"Higher-tier tanks provide vastly more storage, making them ideal for keeping important chemicals ready for when your production lines need them."
		""
		"Use a &eConfigurator&r to manage connections and control how chemicals flow in and out."
	]
	quest.73156BF022D5710F.quest_subtitle: "Store gases and chemicals"
	quest.73156BF022D5710F.title: "Chemical Tanks"
	task.0AAA27790F8C94A0.title: "Chemical Tanks"
	task.0B2C0AF7B7B4B841.title: "Thermodynamic Conductors"
	task.0B9C85688F6EEAFB.title: "Fluid Tanks"
	task.29E9B2B466DF099E.title: "QIO Drives"
	task.2E011A6CEC3FE9F6.title: "Pressurized Tubes"
	task.341F7CB191A0790A.title: "Universal Cables"
	task.53EBF200E3ED18E8.title: "Energy Cubes"
	task.59BF158D97C90086.title: "Bins"
	task.741F21CA04FBCB90.title: "Logistical Transporters"
	task.7DFBA79EE9616973.title: "Mechanical Pipes"
}
